	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quo consilio comitia a vestro senatu con<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scripta abrogata sint, divinare non possum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Aut concilium nullum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>est futurum hoc anno propter bellicos tumultus, aut pontificii timores <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>incutiunt, quominus coeatis de rebus Christi consulturi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Et <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>profecto craves suppeditat cogitationes hęc in negotio domini procrasti<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>natio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Consilium vestrum non improbo; sed si imperiales civitates <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quosdam sunt missuri, sicuti mihi scribitur ex <placeName ref="l284">Lypsia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l558">Witemberga</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>, quod missuri sunt doctos et pios ad conferendum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>scripturas, de quibus est controversia, si autem locus non dabitur conferendi, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>abituri sunt salva fide data, quid si <placeName ref="l862">Helveticę</placeName> civitates <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>item quosdam mitterent, unum et alterum?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Certe non peccarent.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dico <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>autem, si imperator, non papa ad concilium vocaret.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quis enim securitatem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>daret papa vocante, qui perpetuo impius fuit et nullius fidei erga <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>veros Christi ministros?</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Vexabunt nos impii homines isto praetextu <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et novum bellum, si dominus non averterit, instituent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Cęterum novi nihil habemus de <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Bellum adhuc viget <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2301">Osiander</persName> insanit impensissime et turbat totam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l2562">Prussiam</placeName> suis somniis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Incendiarii multi emissi sunt, duos habent <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sacerdotes, qui illos ducunt et primas inter eos tenent, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quos perdet dominus absque dubio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sunt papalia arma, quibus <placeName ref="l822">Ger<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>maniam</placeName> perdere conatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Scriptum papę universitati nostrę datum, praecipue rectori; ille <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dedit theologis nostris duobus, <persName ref="p8298">Borrhao</persName> et <persName ref="p3988">Wolffio</persName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hi vocarunt pa<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>stores, sed nihildum consultarunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Mirum episcopum nostrum nihil <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ad nos scribere hac de re; an non sumus ecclesiae illius membra?</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>an nihil nos curat et putat abiectos esse ab ecclesia catholica?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Doli et machinae sunt, quibus nos interficere conantur absque <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dubio.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">21. iulii 1551.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine meo <persName ref="p8171">Theo<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>dorum</persName>, a quo expecto literas<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Constantes <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>estote.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem hoch- und wolgelerten <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>herren meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName>, lutpriester zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mynem gunstigen, lieben herren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>